text:
Please product ta kenar age review ta pore nin;

Photo te Deya keyboard er sate mil nai. Rgb light 5 ta thakar kota, ace 3 ta. Font same na. Kubhi baje packaging, R sobceye boro problem holo keyboard baka. Type korar somoy norbore hoye jay. Very bad experience. Money wasted. 

Edit : Bad review dewar por seller er behavior cilo hotasha jonok. Kenar age bhebe dekben.
